OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start, with overnight
OL,6,Frain continuing and spreading to all
OL,7,Fparts. Rain gradually easing from the
OL,8,Fwest through the afternoon and the
OL,9,Fchance of some coastal showers from
OL,10,Flate afternoon onwards.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSkies will clear over night
OL,13,Fwith some showers lingering in the
OL,14,Feast of the region until the morning.
OL,15,FTemperatures will fall making it feel
OL,16,Fcooler than of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
